      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm working on a risk assessment for a warehouse in Rotterdam. Can you give me a breakdown of the primary risk factors we should consider when storing flammable industrial solvents in high-density racking systems? Specifically looking at how the density affects fire spread and containment.",
